Description: Algorithmic live-coding pattern engine, synthesizer, and VST3/CLAP plugin
 SilverWave is a real-time algorithmic music live-coding environment and
 audio plugin combining Strudel and TidalCycles pattern semantics with a
 panic-safe native Rust DSP engine.
